# Issue #39: optional public API base URL (include the agreed API prefix).
# TODO(BE #30): fill this only after the backend address/CORS contract is agreed.
# An explicit baseUrl passed to createApiClient takes precedence.
# The empty root route does not construct a client and needs no configuration.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are browser-visible. Never place secrets or tokens here.
